  "rendered": "From Juárez tunnel to El Paso drains: Underground crossings remain border enforcement challenge"
 },
 "content": {
  "rendered": "\n<p>EL PASO, Texas (Border Report)—New video from U.S. Border Patrol is putting fresh attention on an underground smuggling problem that federal authorities continue to confront along the El Paso-Ciudad Juárez border.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Border Patrol video shows several migrants covered in mud after authorities say they traveled through underground infrastructure near the border.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-nexstar-video\"> <div id=\"story-embed-1\" class=\"nexstar-video\" data-player-location=\"Story Embed\"    > <video id=\"nxsplayer_f30f0d9e4e\" class=\"video-js vjs-nexstar-skin\" data-nexstar-video=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;12140579&quot;,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;anvato&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;12140579&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;video&quot;,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;anvato&quot;,&quot;station&quot;:&quot;kxan&quot;,&quot;playlistId&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;preRoll&quot;:true,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Tunnels VO Border Report&quot;,&quot;titleVisible&quot;:true,&quot;isEmbed&quot;:false,&quot;allowEmbedInPlayer&quot;:true,&quot;adTagUrl&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;recommendations&quot;:false,&quot;player&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;has_auth&quot;:false,&quot;floating_enabled&quot;:null,&quot;player_location&quot;:&quot;Story Embed&quot;},&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;pluginConfig&quot;:{&quot;share&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:true,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.borderreport.com\\/video\\/tunnels-vo-border-report\\/12140579&quot;,&quot;embedCode&quot;:&quot;&lt;iframe id=\\&quot;nxs-video-iframe-1\\&quot; frameborder=\\&quot;0\\&quot; allowfullscreen loading=\\&quot;lazy\\&quot; style=\\&quot;width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16\\/9; \\&quot; src=\\&quot;https:\\/\\/redir1.borderreport.com\\/nxs-video\\/vid-anvato-12140579\\/embed\\/?injected_via=embed&#038;post_id=3078323\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;nofollow\\&quot; width=\\&quot;640\\&quot; height=\\&quot;320\\&quot;&gt;&lt;\\/iframe&gt;&